What This Tool Does

Updates package lists

Installs selected packages

Creates a new user

Grants sudo access to the new user

Configures the firewall

Enables selected services

Applies basic SSH hardening

Saves logs for review

Important Note

This tool is for educational and authorized administration purposes only.
Always test it in a virtual machine before using it on a production server.

